  "description": "Why Choose Actbest Striker Max?\nStriker Max High-Performance Electric Bike for Young Adults: Express Your Style, Dominate Every Terrain.\nEngineered for thrill-seekers and trendsetters, the Striker Max is equipped with a massive 3000W peak power dual motor system that delivers jaw-dropping acceleration and raw power. With a blistering top speed of 38+mph, this fast electric bike lets you effortlessly leave traffic behind and satisfy your craving for speed. Powering your adrenaline-fueled rides is a robust 52V 20Ah dual battery system, offering an industry-leading range of up to 120 miles per charge. Whether you are daily commuting or embarking on long weekend road trips, this dual battery electric bike ensures you spend more time riding and less time worrying about range.\nBuilt to conquer any landscape, the 20\" x 4.0\" all-terrain fat tires provide superior grip and stability, allowing you to seamlessly transition from city streets and highways to rugged mountain trails, sandy beaches, and even snow. When navigating these diverse conditions at high speeds, control is paramount. That’s why the Striker Max features premium dual hydraulic brakes for instant, precise stopping power. Paired with a smooth Shimano 7-speed transmission, this all-terrain fat tire ebike offers a highly customizable riding experience that adapts instantly to your environment and riding style.\nRide in ultimate comfort and bold style with a top-tier suspension system—featuring a hydraulic suspension front fork and dual rear shock absorbers—designed to absorb the harshest bumps for a buttery-smooth ride. Tech-savvy riders will love the centered large color LCD display, boasting high clarity and color saturation to track your ride stats at a glance. Complete with an IPX5 waterproof rating and upgraded front and rear lights for safe night riding, its sleek, aggressive design turns heads wherever you go. For young riders seeking a personalized, high-speed electric motorcycle alternative, the Striker Max delivers the ultimate fusion of cutting-edge aesthetics and unstoppable power.",
